journey
    title What the AGENT experiences - one browser tab, no desk phone (D32)
    section Starting a shift
      Opens the workstation URL: 4: Agent
      Runs the mic and headset self-test: 3: Agent
      Sets themself Ready: 5: Agent
    section A call arrives
      Offer card appears, the BROWSER rings: 4: Agent
      Reads who, why and urgency BEFORE accepting: 5: Agent
      Presses Accept: 5: Agent
    section On the call
      Opens already knowing the context: 5: Agent
      Confirms identity, unlocking policy details: 4: Agent
      Asks for the policy number to be TYPED: 5: Agent
      Follows the recommended actions: 4: Agent
      Sees both sides transcribed live: 4: Agent
    section Wrapping up
      Call ends, drops into After Call Work: 4: Agent
      Edits the pre-filled summary: 4: Agent
      Picks a disposition and presses Done: 5: Agent
      Returns to Available: 5: Agent
